      "search:description": "Infectious cell culture supernatant containing SARS-CoV-2 (strain hCoV-19/Slovenia/LP3/25/24; lineage Omicron, LB.1). This strain is preserved in viral storage medium -80°C. To confirm its identity the virus has been completely sequenced.",
