      "dcterms:title": "Primers, Probes and target-specific positive controls for Monkeypox virus and Orthopoxviruses detection ",
      "dcterms:description": "Target-specific synthetic DNA  of Monkeypox virus (real time PCR targeting region of the F3L gene) and Orthopoxviruses DNA detection (real time PCR targeting region of the OPE9L gene) for 100 Rxns. Provided as lyophilized DNA material ready to use after resuspension.  \r\nAND Lyophilized  ready-to-use primers and probe (Lyoph-P&P) for real time PCR targeting region of the F3L gene of Monkeypox virus (96 rxns in the form of 4x 24 rnxs) + Lyophilized  ready-to-use primers and probe (Lyoph-P&P) for real time PCR targeting region of the OPE9L gene of orthopoxviruses (96 rxns in the form of 4x 24 rnxs). \r\nSOPs in the attached pdf.\r\nReference article : Kulesh D.A. et al. 2003:Smallpox and pan-Orthopox Virus Detection by Real-Time 3-Minor Groove Binder TaqMan Assays on the Roche LightCycler and the Cepheid Smart Cycler Platforms.\r\nDisclaimer: This product does not contain the polymerase",
