      "dcterms:issued": "2021-06-07T16:40:59+02:00",
      "dcterms:modified": "2024-08-21T18:24:22+02:00",
      "dcterms:title": "Extraction and real time RT-PCR control (ArRNA MS2) for swab, urine and stool samples",
      "dcterms:description": "Lyophilized encapsidated RNA (ArRNA) contains a region of the MS2 phage and is used as positive control for extraction and real time RT-PCR. The ArRNA is especially developed to be spiked in nasopharyngeal, salivary, urine and stool samples. Extraction is mandatory before use in real time RT-PCR. Packaged for 100 Rxns, for RUO (Research Use Only). SOPs in the attached pdf.",
