      "search:sku": "005V-05759",
      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2, 2023, Slovenia, 21K/Omicron (lineage FL.15)",
      "search:description": "Infectious cell culture supernatant containing SARS-CoV-2 (strain hCoV-19/Slovenia/LP3/58/23; lineage Omicron, FL.15). This strain is preserved in viral storage medium -80°C. To confirm its identity the virus has been completely sequenced.",
